  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "photograph.",
  "speech_off": 13.6,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 14.85
 },
 {
  "n": 6,
  "text": "The trick is timing: light that reaches / him takes the long way round,",
  "start": 14.406,
  "end": 18.433,
  "first_word": "The",
  "word_frame": 434,
  "onset": 14.39,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -0.48,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.82,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "round,",
  "speech_off": 18.06,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 11.19
 },
 {
  "n": 7,
  "text": "so it comes back later.",
  "start": 18.513,
  "end": 19.853,
  "first_word": "so",
  "word_frame": 557,
  "onset": 18.37,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -4.29,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.61,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "later.",
  "speech_off": 19.67,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 5.49
 },
 {
  "n": 8,
  "text": "A few billionths of a second later.",
  "start": 19.933,
  "end": 22.003,
  "first_word": "A",
  "word_frame": 600,
  "onset": 19.95,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 0.51,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.01,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "later.",
  "speech_off": 21.75,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 7.59
 },
 {
  "n": 9,
  "text": "This takes a time-of-flight sensor,",
  "start": 22.083,
  "end": 24.003,
  "first_word": "This",
  "word_frame": 665,
  "onset": 22.09,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 0.21,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.51,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "sensor,",
  "speech_off": 23.74,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 7.89
 },
 {
  "n": 10,
  "text": "a camera that clocks / its own light's round trip.",
  "start": 24.083,
  "end": 26.648,
  "first_word": "a",
  "word_frame": 725,
  "onset": 24.12,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 1.11,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.51,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "trip.",
  "speech_off": 26.41,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 7.14
 },
 {
  "n": 11,
  "text": "So how do you turn a tiny / delay into a location?",
  "start": 26.728,
  "end": 30.535,
  "first_word": "So",
  "word_frame": 804,
  "onset": 26.69,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -1.14,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.16,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "location?",
  "speech_off": 30.03,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 15.15
 },
 {
  "n": 12,
  "text": "First, a puzzle: why does / a plain wall work at all?",
  "start": 30.678,
  "end": 34.271,
  "first_word": "First,",
  "word_frame": 922,
  "onset": 30.71,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 0.96,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.66,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "all?",
  "speech_off": 34.06,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 6.33
 },
 {
  "n": 13,
  "text": "Put a mirror here, / and our friend is simply visible.",
  "start": 34.351,
  "end": 37.428,
  "first_word": "Put",
  "word_frame": 1033,
  "onset": 34.34,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -0.33,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.47,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "visible.",
  "speech_off": 37.16,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 8.04
 },
 {
  "n": 14,
  "text": "A painted wall is rough up close.",
  "start": 37.508,
  "end": 39.988,
  "first_word": "A",
  "word_frame": 1127,
  "onset": 37.64,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 3.96,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.76,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "close.",
  "speech_off": 39.74,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 7.44
 },
 {
  "n": 15,
  "text": "It throws light every which way, / so each spot acts less like a mirror,",
  "start": 40.068,
  "end": 44.228,
  "first_word": "It",
  "word_frame": 1204,
  "onset": 40.1,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 0.96,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.96,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "mirror,",
  "speech_off": 44.11,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 3.54
 },
 {
  "n": 16,
  "text": "more like a tiny lamp.",
  "start": 44.308,
  "end": 45.868,
  "first_word": "more",
  "word_frame": 1331,
  "onset": 44.31,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 0.06,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.76,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "lamp.",
  "speech_off": 45.48,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 11.64
 },
 {
  "n": 17,
  "text": "Everything coming back / is a blend of many paths.",
  "start": 45.948,
  "end": 48.885,
  "first_word": "Everything",
  "word_frame": 1380,
  "onset": 45.81,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -4.14,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.56,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "paths.",
  "speech_off": 48.44,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 13.35
 },
 {
  "n": 18,
  "text": "What survives is timing.",
  "start": 48.965,
  "end": 50.988,
  "first_word": "What",
  "word_frame": 1471,
  "onset": 48.92,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -1.35,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.05,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "timing.",
  "speech_off": 50.74,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 7.44
 },
 {
  "n": 19,
  "text": "Nearly everything coming back / bounced once, off the wall.",
  "start": 51.068,
  "end": 54.453,
  "first_word": "Nearly",
  "word_frame": 1534,
  "onset": 51.11,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 1.26,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.96,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "wall.",
  "speech_off": 54.25,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 6.09
 },
 {
  "n": 20,
  "text": "Our friend's echo bounced / three times, so it's tiny.",
  "start": 54.533,
  "end": 57.583,
  "first_word": "Our",
  "word_frame": 1638,
  "onset": 54.57,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 1.11,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.01,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "tiny.",
  "speech_off": 57.43,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 4.59
 },
 {
  "n": 21,
  "text": "This is real data from the same team,",
  "start": 57.663,
  "end": 59.863,
  "first_word": "This",
  "word_frame": 1732,
  "onset": 57.76,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 2.91,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.11,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "team,",
  "speech_off": 59.82,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 1.29
 },
 {
  "n": 22,
  "text": "with a different sensor and hidden / object: the wall's big echo, then,",
  "start": 59.943,
  "end": 64.623,
  "first_word": "with",
  "word_frame": 1800,
  "onset": 59.99,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 1.41,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.71,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "then,",
  "speech_off": 64.61,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 0.39
 },
 {
  "n": 23,
  "text": "a few nanoseconds later, / a bump you have to zoom in to see.",
  "start": 64.703,
  "end": 68.436,
  "first_word": "a",
  "word_frame": 1943,
  "onset": 64.76,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 1.71,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.91,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "see.",
  "speech_off": 68.04,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 11.88
 },
 {
  "n": 24,
  "text": "In this capture, hundreds of times weaker.",
  "start": 68.516,
  "end": 71.503,
  "first_word": "In",
  "word_frame": 2057,
  "onset": 68.47,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -1.38,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.52,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "weaker.",
  "speech_off": 71.13,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 11.19
 },
 {
  "n": 25,
  "text": "That bump is the clue.",
  "start": 71.583,
  "end": 73.233,
  "first_word": "That",
  "word_frame": 2149,
  "onset": 71.6,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 0.51,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.51,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "clue.",
  "speech_off": 72.98,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 7.59
 },
 {
  "n": 26,
  "text": "Its timing says how much / farther the light travelled.",
  "start": 73.313,
  "end": 76.403,
  "first_word": "Its",
  "word_frame": 2201,
  "onset": 73.3,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -0.39,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.61,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "travelled.",
  "speech_off": 75.76,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 19.29
 },
 {
  "n": 27,
  "text": "Farther from where?",
  "start": 76.483,
  "end": 77.843,
  "first_word": "Farther",
  "word_frame": 2296,
  "onset": 76.43,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -1.59,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.51,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "where?",
  "speech_off": 77.49,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 10.59
 },
 {
  "n": 28,
  "text": "Simplify it: the sensor flashes / and listens at one spot on the wall.",
  "start": 77.923,
  "end": 82.088,
  "first_word": "Simplify",
  "word_frame": 2340,
  "onset": 77.96,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 1.11,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.31,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "wall.",
  "speech_off": 81.95,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 4.14
 },
 {
  "n": 29,
  "text": "Light covers about thirty / centimetres every nanosecond.",
  "start": 82.168,
  "end": 85.448,
  "first_word": "Light",
  "word_frame": 2467,
  "onset": 82.23,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 1.86,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.96,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "nanosecond.",
  "speech_off": 85.06,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 11.64
 },
 {
  "n": 30,
  "text": "But the detour is there and back, / so each extra nanosecond puts him",
  "start": 85.528,
  "end": 89.928,
  "first_word": "But",
  "word_frame": 2568,
  "onset": 85.48,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -1.44,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.16,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "him",
  "speech_off": null,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": null
 },
 {
  "n": 31,
  "text": "only about fifteen centimetres / farther from the wall spot.",
  "start": 90.008,
  "end": 93.163,
  "first_word": "only",
  "word_frame": 2702,
  "onset": null,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": null,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.76,
  "continuous": true,
  "last_word": "spot.",
  "speech_off": 92.95,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 6.39
 },
 {
  "n": 32,
  "text": "Measure the extra delay, and you / know how far he is from that spot.",
  "start": 93.243,
  "end": 96.838,
  "first_word": "Measure",
  "word_frame": 2799,
  "onset": 93.28,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 1.11,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.71,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "spot.",
  "speech_off": 96.63,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 6.24
 },
 {
  "n": 33,
  "text": "Not which direction. Just how far.",
  "start": 96.918,
  "end": 99.253,
  "first_word": "Not",
  "word_frame": 2910,
  "onset": 96.95,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 0.96,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.46,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "far.",
  "speech_off": 99.11,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 4.29
 },
 {
  "n": 34,
  "text": "He could be anywhere on this arc, / all the same distance from that spot.",
  "start": 99.333,
  "end": 103.223,
  "first_word": "He",
  "word_frame": 2982,
  "onset": 99.39,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 1.71,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.01,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "spot.",
  "speech_off": 102.9,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 9.69
 },
 {
  "n": 35,
  "text": "Now listen at a second spot.",
  "start": 103.303,
  "end": 105.143,
  "first_word": "Now",
  "word_frame": 3101,
  "onset": 103.39,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 2.61,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.91,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "spot.",
  "speech_off": 104.89,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 7.59
 },
 {
  "n": 36,
  "text": "Another delay, another arc.",
  "start": 105.223,
  "end": 107.328,
  "first_word": "Another",
  "word_frame": 3159,
  "onset": 105.21,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -0.39,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.31,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "arc.",
  "speech_off": 107.09,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 7.14
 },
 {
  "n": 37,
  "text": "On this side of the wall, / they cross in just one place.",
  "start": 107.408,
  "end": 111.268,
  "first_word": "On",
  "word_frame": 3224,
  "onset": 107.4,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -0.24,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.76,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "place.",
  "speech_off": 110.83,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 13.14
 },
 {
  "n": 38,
  "text": "Measured timings are a bit fuzzy, / so each arc is really a band,",
  "start": 111.348,
  "end": 115.228,
  "first_word": "Measured",
  "word_frame": 3342,
  "onset": 111.41,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 1.86,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.56,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "band,",
  "speech_off": 115.14,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 2.64
 },
 {
  "n": 39,
  "text": "and the bands overlap in a small patch.",
  "start": 115.308,
  "end": 117.433,
  "first_word": "and",
  "word_frame": 3461,
  "onset": 115.36,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 1.56,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.76,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "patch.",
  "speech_off": 117.31,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 3.69
 },
 {
  "n": 40,
  "text": "These two spots are close, / so the patch is long and blurry.",
  "start": 117.513,
  "end": 121.033,
  "first_word": "These",
  "word_frame": 3527,
  "onset": 117.59,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 2.31,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.61,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "blurry.",
  "speech_off": 120.74,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 8.79
 },
 {
  "n": 41,
  "text": "Spread them out, and it shrinks.",
  "start": 121.113,
  "end": 122.853,
  "first_word": "Spread",
  "word_frame": 3635,
  "onset": 121.13,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 0.51,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.61,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "shrinks.",
  "speech_off": 122.72,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 3.99
 },
 {
  "n": 42,
  "text": "In practice, a computer / weighs many spots at once,",
  "start": 122.933,
  "end": 126.293,
  "first_word": "In",
  "word_frame": 3690,
  "onset": 123.06,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 3.81,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.01,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "once,",
  "speech_off": 126.02,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 8.19
 },
 {
  "n": 43,
  "text": "trying positions and keeping those / whose predicted echoes match.",
  "start": 126.373,
  "end": 129.743,
  "first_word": "trying",
  "word_frame": 3793,
  "onset": 126.32,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -1.59,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.81,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "match.",
  "speech_off": 129.56,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 5.49
 },
 {
  "n": 44,
  "text": "It also leans on assumptions, / like what kind of object it's after.",
  "start": 129.823,
  "end": 133.563,
  "first_word": "It",
  "word_frame": 3897,
  "onset": 129.88,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 1.71,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 2.31,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "after.",
  "speech_off": 133.32,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 7.29
 },
 {
  "n": 45,
  "text": "That's why the answer is a likely / location, or a rough shape.",
  "start": 133.643,
  "end": 137.496,
  "first_word": "That's",
  "word_frame": 4011,
  "onset": 133.65,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": 0.21,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.71,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "shape.",
  "speech_off": 137.23,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 7.98
 },
 {
  "n": 46,
  "text": "And here's a real one.",
  "start": 137.576,
  "end": 139.483,
  "first_word": "And",
  "word_frame": 4129,
  "onset": 137.52,
  "lead_vs_onset_frames": -1.68,
  "lead_vs_wordframe": 1.72,
  "continuous": false,
  "last_word": "one.",
  "speech_off": 139.42,
  "out_minus_speech_off_frames": 1.89
 },
 {
  "n": 47,
  "text": "Moved through known positions, / the sensor behind that faint bump",
